{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2037,
  "hub_id": 2719,
  "guid": "com.szonszczyk.coloredtracers",
  "name": "Colored Tracers",
  "slug": "colored-tracers",
  "teaser": "Bullets now have tracers colored by their penetration value!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/6HlygqMjyIzEZEizPkbSOyzw9EJ0BR76NCRQVbEE.jpg",
  "downloads": 10477,
  "favourites_count": 10,
  "description": "<p><em>In the heat of battle, quickly determine who poses the real threat. Red tracers from the right - just Scavs. Green tracers from the left - PMCs. But from the center, someone is firing violet tracers at you… It’s clearly Birdeye.</em></p>\n<p><em>You don’t even need to see your enemies - just a split second, and you already know everything. Now you can plan accordingly… This raid is yours to win!</em></p>\n<h2><strong>Features</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Coloring tracers:\n<ul>\n<li>Based on either bullet damage or penetration</li>\n<li>With linear rainbow color scale (red-worst, violet-best)</li>\n<li>With 7-steps color profile with rainbow or customizable colors</li>\n<li>Single color that can be added based on bullet category</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Option to invert scales (violet-worst, red-best)</li>\n<li>Option to color bullet to random color</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Choose your preferred mode in the config file</strong></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Screenshots</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1DIeiMf.png\" alt=\"1DIeiMf.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cVsWen9.png\" alt=\"cVsWen9.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C27Sgbu.png\" alt=\"C27Sgbu.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Rainbow Color Scale</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>The mod uses a rainbow scale to represent bullet values:</p>\n<p>Red → lowest value</p>\n<p>Orange / Yellow / Green / Blue → average value</p>\n<p>Violet → strongest value</p>\n<p>This allows you to instantly judge ammo performance just by looking at tracer color!</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Compatibility</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Compatible with all mods that add new bullets or calibers</li>\n<li>Realism compatibility is planned for a future update</li>\n</ul></div></div></div>\n",
  "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2037/colored-tracers",
  "fika_compatibility": true,
  "featured": false,
  "contains_ads": false,
  "contains_ai_content": true,
  "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>I was using ChatGPT to help me with some things:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Thumbnail</li>\n<li>Function to generate linear color based on value and maxValue</li>\n<li>Mod description, changelog and config was checked for potential errors</li>\n</ul>\n",
